 ## 검토와 통합
 
 담당자가 바뀌었다는 이유만으로 작업자의 유효한 검사 결과를 다시 실행하지 않는다.
diff --git a/instructions/implementation-delegation.md b/instructions/implementation-delegation.md
index b53be49..3a318fa 100644
--- a/instructions/implementation-delegation.md
+++ b/instructions/implementation-delegation.md
@@ -36,6 +36,13 @@ Never overlap conflicting ownership. Shared files, lockfiles, generated outputs,
 directories make tasks sequential unless the plan supplies independent resources for each task. Disjoint
 files alone do not prove independence.
 
+A worktree supplies those resources for files inside the working tree. Tasks that can each be built and verified on
+their own and share only files inside the working tree, such as build output, generated files, or a lockfile, run in
+parallel with one worktree per worker, created through the Orca route of [cross-repository work](cross-repository.md) in
+an Orca terminal and through the host's own isolation or a plain Git worktree elsewhere. The main session integrates the
+branches and runs the integration checks. Tasks that share a database, a port, or another resource outside the working
+tree stay sequential.
+
 ## Review and integration
 
 A worker's valid result does not need a duplicate run merely because ownership changed.
